{"scene_id": "s01213", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01213.fountain", "heading": "INT. ACCORDION REPAIR SHOP - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "OSWALDO PRENTISS-LAMB", "names": ["OSWALDO PRENTISS-LAMB", "OSWALDO"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "TEDDY", "names": ["TEDDY"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 2, "name": "ASANTE", "names": ["ASANTE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ACCORDION REPAIR SHOP - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hanging bellows.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Open instruments on workbenches, reeds spread like sleeping insects.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A single lamp.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The smell of glue and old felt.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "OSWALDO PRENTISS-LAMB (50s, rolled sleeves, magnifying visor) bends over a half-disassembled accordion.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "In the doorway, rain on her coat, stands THEODORA \"TEDDY\" ASANTE (40s, a black case in her hand), who hasn't been here in years.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're closed.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You never close.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes off the visor.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Sets it down.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "She sets the case on the counter and clicks it open: an accordion, scarred, one strap mended with fishing line.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You kept it.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I kept everything.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "He crosses to her slowly, wipes his hands on his apron, and lifts the instrument with both hands, turning it over like an infant.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy folds her arms, then unfolds them, then reaches out and touches the keys without pressing.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The left side's wheezing.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It always wheezed.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not like this.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "He presses the bellows.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "A long, tired breath.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "They both listen.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "A chord, soft and sour, hangs between them.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy closes her eyes.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Oswaldo sets it down and hesitates, hands hovering.", "para": 4, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Can you fix it?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I could.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "But?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a better sound broken.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs, a short, wet laugh, and wipes her eyes with her coat sleeve.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "He offers a rag.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes it and does not use it.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain drums the window.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "She picks up the case and shuts it, gently, over the instrument.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll come back for it.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said that before.", "name": "OSWALDO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "She walks out.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The bell over the door rings.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "He stands at the counter with the open lid, listening to the last note fade from the felt.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}